WEBVTT

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.980
I can't wait...

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:41.910
I feel...

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.450
...like I'm slowly climbing
the stairs to adulthood.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:49.830
How?

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.750
When I sent a text invite
to Kobayakawa-san,

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.460
I managed it easily!

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.460
That's it?!

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.630
Hey! What's up, guys?

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.960
I sent Kobayakawa-san—

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.060
Wow, is that so?

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.190
Uh, I hadn't said anything yet.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.310
Is that a costume?

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.540
Yeah! For the basketball team's play.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.010
They asked me to help out.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.270
I'm Saitou Hajime.

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:16.210
Mattsun, we'll be watching
you at the karaoke contest.

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:18.780
Sure! I'm gonna win it
with my beautiful voice.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.390
What other attractions were there?

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.820
The crossdressing contest.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.650
Tsuyopon?

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:27.660
You look exhausted.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.120
Because, thanks to someone,
I'm on the festival committee.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:36.000
Does anyone want to be on the
Festival Executive Committee?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:39.090
We might as well go with
whoever's on day duty today.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.750
That's a good idea!

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:44.920
Today is... lshida-san and Naoe-kun.
Do you mind?

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:45.630
Okay.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.180
Hmm?

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.050
Yay, thanks!

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:49.680
It's settled!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.260
I'm so sorry!

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.440
I won't forgive you.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.770
Check out Chiba-chan in boy's clothes!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.360
Yo.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.330
Hey, you look good.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.520
I look cool, right?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.220
You're totally rocking that look.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.780
Chiba-chan's one of the favorites to win.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.810
Festivals sure are great!
Girls in summer kimonos...

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.890
Do you think we have time
before Kei-chan's play?

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:14.790
Probably.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.630
There's someplace I'd like to stop by.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.460
Kobayakawa-san's classroom.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.590
We don't serve your kind here.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.680
Get lost, will ya?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.760
Um, where is Kobayakawa-san?

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.020
I said beat it!

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:31.930
Hey, Spitting Woman.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:32.830
Huh?

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.350
You're...

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.560
That outfit!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.980
This is not something I wanted to do!

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.320
Let me snap a picture!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:41.400
Get lost, you perv!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.060
Mari-chan, you're on duty...

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:43.070
Get lost, you perv!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:44.780
Hashiba-kun?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.420
K-Kobayakawa-san, hello!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.010
Did you come to visit our café?

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.370
Y-Yeah!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.080
Thank you.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.000
But we're full at the moment.
You might not get a seat.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.460
Business is going well for you.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.470
Don't worry about it, we'll try elsewhere.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:00.380
Sorry.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.480
Oh, but I'll see you tomorrow.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:04.220
Yeah.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.970
I'll come by Class 3's tent
once my shift ends.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.380
Anything you'd like to eat?

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.900
Is there a place with chocolate bananas?

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:12.770
There is!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.070
I said no!

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:14.360
Really? I'm glad.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:14.610
Just one!

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.850
The candied apples looked good, too.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.900
Let's eat our fill!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:20.920
Yeah.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.320
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.390
Booths are now closed for the day.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:27.990
Please return to your homerooms after cleaning up.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.240
It's finally over.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.650
Good work!

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.950
I hear sales were good.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.520
I heard rumors.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:39.790
You tied people up on stage, hung them
from the ceiling, then took out your whip...

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:42.090
I just got into it, you know?

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.170
My brother and the director were pissed.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.470
Naoe-kun!

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.370
We've got trouble!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.480
What?

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:49.930
We saw the play!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.450
You went way too far.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.950
What happened to you?

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.940
I got scratched by a feral cat.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.060
Kobayakawa-san gave me the nicest smile!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.190
Great! Sounds like you had fun.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.420
It wasn't fun.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.070
Taming feral cats like that is the best part.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.040
She won't warm up to me. Ever.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.030
Na-chan.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.950
I need your help with something.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.400
What's that?

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.120
A costume.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.060
For what?

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.030
The crossdressing contest.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.790
The crossdressing contest?

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:23.380
Isn't that where we shoot for laughs
with Buu-chan, who's chubby but can dance?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.920
Bun-chan's come down with a cold.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:27.820
Therefore...

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:28.800
Therefore?

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.970
You're gonna do it.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.720
No way!

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:38.060
Because I'm on the festival committee.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.820
Hashiba-kun...

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.360
It's time to change...

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.450
We're done!

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.520
You look great!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.170
Hilarious!

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.370
You look so gross!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.920
Don't laugh!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.170
You'll have to practice
appealing to the crowd.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.370
What's that?!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.900
The male-role says a saccharine line,

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.590
while the female-role waves.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.010
This is still a bit too large.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.660
Shall we take it in more?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.890
Okay, take it off.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.520
I'm sorry!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.780
I've been drafted into taking
someone's place in my class's event.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.810
And it's tomorrow afternoon, so...

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.850
I'm really sorry to do this
after inviting you and all.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:30.050
I understand.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.290
I guess there's nothing we can do about it.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.510
Was that all you wanted to tell me?

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:36.370
Uh, yeah...

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.460
Well, I have to clean up.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.920
Good luck with your class thing.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.430
She was so... cold...

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:53.550
You shine brighter than the sky's
most beautiful constellation,

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.430
my princess.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.190
That thing we had last time
was, like, so delicious!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.850
You're too embarrassed!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:58.200
I'd totally go again!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.020
Now, put your hand here...

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.690
Good morning.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.940
This is the second day,
which is open to the public.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:14.300
Please prepare your booths at once.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.780
Na-chan.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.290
There's been a change in the program.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.160
The contest starts an hour later.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.940
Kobayakawa-san!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.430
Morning!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:31.310
Listen, about today...

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.840
I'm setting up now.

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.070
Oh, uh, sorry to bother you when you're busy.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:36.510
Um...

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.100
Kobayakawa-san?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.750
It's already noon.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.440
What about Kobayakawa-san?

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.380
She was mad at me.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.110
No, she was rejecting me.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.480
Ignoring me...

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:58.090
You were probably just
in the way of her setting up.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:07:59.870
I've never seen her face like that before.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.770
Did I do something wrong, Tsuyopon?

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.660
Who knows.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.210
Bring out Anna!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:06.790
Pardon?

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.070
You tricked Anna into
coming here, didn't you?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.670
I saw you two talking this morning!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.720
Kobayakawa-san's not here.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.730
You'd better not be lying to me.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.060
I'm not!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.070
Hmph, fine then! See ya!

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:20.900
Wait.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.850
Did something happen to Kobayakawa-san?

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:26.340
She's nowhere to be found.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:29.310
She's not answering her phone either,
and she's not the type to ditch work.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.510
It's your fault.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.240
You made Anna upset!

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:39.010
Huh?

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.620
Kobayakawa-san.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.180
Oh, wow.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.460
It's fun whipping Na-chan with that!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.490
Did Hashiba-kun...

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.840
...say anything ?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.220
Why?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.430
Well...

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.300
He called off our plans,

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.670
and then I saw him being close with a girl.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:12.390
Little things, but... for some reason.
they made me feel very uncomfortable.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:15.490
So I was cold towards him.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:21.830
I know I should apologize for that,
but for some reason, I'm still upset.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.330
Do you know why?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.200
I'll never tell!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.240
Na-chan was pretty disappointed himself.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.250
So annoyed.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:32.750
Really?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.050
Yeah, really!

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.630
He was really unhappy about
being in the crossdressing contest.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.760
The crossdressing contest?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:41.680
There she is!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.570
Kobayakawa-san!

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:44.640
Hashiba-kun?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.350
Speak of the devil...

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:48.110
Care to borrow my whip?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.060
Hold on!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.670
Ciao!

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.690
Hashiba-kun, why are you here?

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.870
Uh? What do you mean, why?

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.550
I thought you were supposed to be busy.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:03.370
Oh, there was a shift in the schedule.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.780
So I'm free now.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.130
I meant to tell you that this morning...

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:09.630
I'm sorry!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.270
I was so unpleasant towards you.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.650
No, it's fine!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.000
I was just worried something had happened.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.460
Tsutsui-san said it was probably my fault.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:22.020
It was more a misunderstanding on my part.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.830
Oh, I see...

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.680
Still...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:28.350
...I was disappointed when
our plans got canceled.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.010
That was part of it.

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:33.080
But that's just me being selfish.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:35.820
Not at all!

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.620
I'm glad you felt that way!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.990
And I'm sorry, too!

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:40.990
Uh...

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.860
S-So...

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.510
It's a bit early, but...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.540
Are you okay with us going around
the school festival together next year?

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:52.960
Sure!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.200
Well, do your best in the
crossdressing contest!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.230
Yeah! I will!

00:10:58.230 --> 00:10:59.670
Huh?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:02.980
Congratulations on first and second place!

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.300
Thanks!

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.650
Na-chan's so cute.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:07.140
Thank—

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:10.310
Wait! Kei-chan, you told Kobayakawa-san!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.230
It just slipped out.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.750
She said she wanted a picture!
What're you going to do about that!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.720
Okay!

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:19.380
Let's snap a few.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:21.650
Yukirin would probably love this.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:25.520
No!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:28.520
Is it here yet?
